Hello everyone, my name is
Tomás, I'm running an AI

00:00:03.467 --> 00:00:08.520
agency in Lisbon where I do AI
projects, especially for process

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:11.500
automatization and also run
a small product venture.

00:00:12.213 --> 00:00:17.133
So today I'm going to talk about how I
use my self-hosted n8n, why I decided

00:00:17.253 --> 00:00:22.620
to do such a setup and also some
advantages, I'll guide you quickly

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:28.100
through my own system, I'll do a very
quick live demo that you guys can scan a QR

00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:31.700
